    "text": "<p>A small charged ball is hovering in the state of equilibrium at a height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math> over a very large horizontal uniformly charged sheet. If a disc of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, is removed from the plate directly underneath the ball, then the acceleration of the ball will be</p>\r"
